{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"6thシングルの\n制作真っ只中～∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイトルはまりかが考えました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今自然豊かなところに\n来ていますヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近すごく自然が多い地に\n行きたいって思ってたから\n嬉しいなぁ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから移動中ずっと\n外を眺めてました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のほほんヽ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/05/21/4784996/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次のシングルはね、\n曲もすごく可愛い雰囲気です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏にみなさんが\nこの曲をあっちこっちで聞いて\n盛り上がってるのが\n目に浮びますぜ｀‐ω‐´)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"曲もダンスもキャピキャピした\n乃木坂って感じ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただね、私マネキンの時以上に\n今ダンスと格闘してるので\n気合いで覚えたいと思います(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やってできないことはなーーーいっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて自分に喝をいれた\nところで前回の乃木どこの話♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初の2期生のみでの\n放送でしたねヽ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の居ないところであんなに\n名前が出るとは思ってなくて\nビックリした(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"滝に打たれる真夏さん\nスカイダイビングをする真夏さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って出たのを見てこの半年間\nなかなかヘビーなことを\nしてきたなぁと実感しました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生ちゃんは一期生を\nさん付けで呼ぶのかなぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『真夏さん』って\nなんだか照れ臭い感じです(｡´･ω･)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『まなったん』くらいが\nちょうどいいんだけどなぁ♪♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばね、最近\n今年中に一人旅を一回は\nしたい！っていう目標が\n立てたんです(ﾉ･v･)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん一人で行くのにオススメな\nところとか知ってます？Σ(σ`･ω･´)σ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも人に引かれちゃうくらいの←\n重度の方向音痴だから←\n初めてのおつかいみたいに\nなりそうだな_(┐「ε:)_"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地図は絶対持って行こう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ...書いてから思い出したけど\n私..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地図読めなかった..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐぅっっヾ(｡><)ｼ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/05/21/4784996/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ♪お知らせお知らせ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオの乃木坂の『の』\n次回は若月・桜井・秋元で\nお送りしちゃいますよ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初 乃木のの♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワチャワチャしててすごーく\n素な感じなので新鮮な真夏を\n見れるはず(*`･ω･´)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな聞いてね～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか自分でまったり,ゆるーり\nとしたラジオ番組を\n担当してみたいなぁなんて\n思ったりもしましたヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/05/21/4784996/0